OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a cyclist
OL,7,Fwas seriously injured during a
OL,8,Fsuspected hit-and-run incident in
OL,9,FCleethorpes.
OL,11,FHumberside Police said it received a
OL,12,Freport that a taxi and a cycle were
OL,13,Finvolved in a collision on Grimsby Road
OL,14,Fat about 05:30 GMT on Sunday.
OL,16,FOfficers said the cyclist, an
OL,17,F18-year-old man, was being treated in
OL,18,Fhospital for serious injuries, although
OL,19,Fthey were not thought to be
OL,20,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
