OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the taxi driver, a
OL,7,F51-year-old man, did not stop at the
OL,8,Fscene and had subsequently been located
OL,9,Fand arrested on suspicion of grievous
OL,10,Fbodily harm with intent.
